@startuml Goods Receipt Verification - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Memverifikasi & Menyelesaikan Penerimaan Barang (Admin Gudang)

actor "Admin Gudang" as Admin
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "GR Resource" as Resource
participant "GoodsReceipt\nModel" as GR
participant "Product\nModel" as Product
participant "PurchaseOrder\nModel" as PO
participant "Shipment\nModel" as Shipment
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Notification" as Notif

== Terima Notifikasi ==
Notif -> Admin: Notifikasi:\n"Goods Receipt created (Pending)"

== Lihat Goods Receipt ==
Admin -> UI: Akses menu Goods Receipt
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request GR list (status=Pending)
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query goods receipts where status=Pending
activate DB
DB --> Resource: GR data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: GR list
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan daftar GR (Pending)
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Pilih Goods Receipt
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request GR details
activate Resource
Resource -> GR: Get GR with details
activate GR
GR -> DB: Query GR & dokumen POD
activate DB
DB --> GR: Complete data
deactivate DB
GR --> Resource: GR with full details
deactivate GR
Resource --> UI: GR detail & dokumen POD
deactivate Resource
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan detail GR & dokumen
deactivate UI

Admin -> Admin: Verifikasi data dengan dokumen POD

alt Data Sesuai
    == Verifikasi ==
    Admin -> UI: Klik "Verifikasi Penerimaan"
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Request verify
    activate Resource
    Resource -> GR: Mark as Verified
    activate GR
    GR -> DB: Update status=Verified
    activate DB
    DB --> GR: Success
    deactivate DB
    GR --> Resource: Updated
    deactivate GR
    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: "GR Verified"
    deactivate UI

    == Selesaikan Penerimaan ==
    Admin -> UI: Klik "Selesaikan Penerimaan"
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Confirm completion
    activate Resource

    note right of Resource
        Database Transaction Start:
        All operations below run atomically
    end note

    Resource -> Product: Update stock for each product
    activate Product
    Product -> DB: Increase stock quantity\n& log stock movement
    activate DB
    DB --> Product: Success
    deactivate DB
    Product --> Resource: Stock updated
    deactivate Product

    Resource -> PO: Update PO received quantities\n& status
    activate PO
    PO -> DB: Update quantities & status\n(Pending → Partial → Completed)
    activate DB
    DB --> PO: Success
    deactivate DB
    PO --> Resource: PO updated
    deactivate PO

    Resource -> Shipment: Mark as Processed
    activate Shipment
    Shipment -> DB: Update status=Processed
    activate DB
    DB --> Shipment: Success
    deactivate DB
    Shipment --> Resource: Shipment updated
    deactivate Shipment

    Resource -> GR: Mark as Completed
    activate GR
    GR -> DB: Update status=Completed
    activate DB
    DB --> GR: Success
    deactivate DB
    GR --> Resource: GR completed
    deactivate GR

    note right of Resource
        Transaction Commit
    end note

    Resource -> Notif: Send notification to Accounting
    activate Notif
    Notif --> Resource: Sent
    deactivate Notif

    alt Has Rejected Products
        Resource -> Notif: Send notification to Supplier\nabout rejections
        activate Notif
        Notif --> Resource: Sent
        deactivate Notif
    end

    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: "Penerimaan selesai"
    deactivate UI

else Data Tidak Sesuai
    Admin -> UI: Kembalikan ke Checker
    activate UI
    UI -> Resource: Return to checker with notes
    activate Resource

    Resource -> GR: Keep status=Pending\n& add issue notes
    activate GR
    GR -> DB: Update notes
    activate DB
    DB --> GR: Success
    deactivate DB
    GR --> Resource: Updated
    deactivate GR

    Resource -> Notif: Send notification to Checker
    activate Notif
    Notif --> Resource: Sent
    deactivate Notif

    Resource --> UI: Success response
    deactivate Resource
    UI --> Admin: "Issue reported"
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml
